sequenceDiagram
    participant N as Notebook
    participant P as PyMongo client
    participant M as MongoDB
    N->>P: Connect using protected URI
    P->>M: Select practice database and collection
    N->>P: Insert fictional sample documents
    P->>M: insert_one / insert_many
    M-->>P: Inserted identifiers
    N->>P: Query with filter and projection
    P->>M: find
    M-->>N: Matching documents
    N->>P: Update known sample document
    P->>M: update_one
    M-->>N: Matched and modified counts
    N->>P: Delete only practice record
    P->>M: delete_one
    M-->>N: Deleted count
